WEBVTT

00:08:59.935 --> 00:09:01.127
questioning every claim,

00:09:01.151 --> 00:09:02.593
demanding evidence --

00:09:02.617 --> 00:09:04.334
great, that's real skepticism.

00:09:05.397 --> 00:09:08.027
Dumb skepticism:
it sounds like skepticism,

00:09:08.051 --> 00:09:11.042
but it's actually closer
to knee-jerk contrarianism.

00:09:11.817 --> 00:09:13.390
Everyone says the earth is round,

00:09:13.414 --> 00:09:14.770
you say it's flat.

00:09:14.794 --> 00:09:16.361
Everyone says racism is bad,

00:09:16.385 --> 00:09:18.970
you say, "I dunno,
I'm skeptical about that."

00:09:19.682 --> 00:09:23.801
I cannot tell you how many young white men
I have spoken to in the last few years

00:09:23.825 --> 00:09:24.981
who have said,

00:09:25.005 --> 00:09:28.405
"You know, the media, my teachers,
they're all trying to indoctrinate me

00:09:28.429 --> 00:09:30.952
into believing in male privilege
and white privilege,